    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATTENTION ALL CITIZENS!</h2><br>The Colonial Administration is hiring potential new station operators with specifications stated bellow:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Age over 26<br></li><li>Completed military service<br></li><li>No living family members<br></li><li>CCR (Citizen Credential Score) over 9.5<br></li><li>Clear medical history</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU <u>ARE</u> ALONE</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/8641ac9fddf4d427a70ca9beaaf4109e.poster.avif?t=1751434293\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/8641ac9fddf4d427a70ca9beaaf4109e.webm?t=1751434293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/8641ac9fddf4d427a70ca9beaaf4109e.mp4?t=1751434293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Embark on a space odyssey and take command of an aging space station. Oversee its operations and make you Empire proud. Your actions will have consequences. You are an important influence over the fate of not only your station but the very planet it watches over.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR MAIN ROLES:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Station Operations</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/658ca5133b01128bb4c911ab8167f418.poster.avif?t=1751434293\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/658ca5133b01128bb4c911ab8167f418.webm?t=1751434293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/658ca5133b01128bb4c911ab8167f418.mp4?t=1751434293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Planet Forces are relying on success. Your planet is a vital part of human colonial expansion.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Maintain and Protect</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/39e0d53ab89e01a76ba1cf065060999f.poster.avif?t=1751434293\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/39e0d53ab89e01a76ba1cf065060999f.webm?t=1751434293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/39e0d53ab89e01a76ba1cf065060999f.mp4?t=1751434293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>From reactor controlling to the life support system, you station is your and your responsibility <br>alone. Make it right and do not fail!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage Your Resources</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/98ae1322e48e0491f1813c014c83ed43.avif?t=1751434293\" width=600 height=192 /></span><br>Every component may become important. Store, recycle and repair. Surviving space is not easy.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your Choices Are Bound With Lives</li></ul>Your position in the colonial exploitation is important. Take actions wisely. The Empire is counting on you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE NEEDED!</h2>The prosperous planets of the inner ring is thankful for your service. Join the Colonial Administration Space Operators Program and secure the future of our kind. Join a camaraderie to fight for human prosperity. Return home with thick bonuses and the everlasting honor.<br><br><i>&quot;Our colonial program is nothing but the reflection our greatness&quot;</i><br>14th President Of The Inner Systems<br>Rufus Collins",
