f418.mp4?t=1751434293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Planet Forces are relying on success. Your planet is a vital part of human colonial expansion.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Maintain and Protect</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/39e0d53ab89e01a76ba1cf065060999f.poster.avif?t=1751434293\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/39e0d53ab89e01a76ba1cf065060999f.webm?t=1751434293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/39e0d53ab89e01a76ba1cf065060999f.mp4?t=1751434293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>From reactor controlling to the life support system, you station is your and your responsibility <br>alone. Make it right and do not fail!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage Your Resources</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699650/extras/98ae1322e48e0491f1813c014c83ed43.avif?t=1751434293\" width=600 height=192 /></span><br>Every component may become important. Store, recycle and repair. Surviving space is not easy.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your Choices Are Bound With Lives</li></ul>Your position in the colonial exploitation is important. Take actions wisely. The Empire is counting on you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE NEEDED!</h2>The prosperous planets of the inner ring is thankful for your service. Join the Colonial Administration Space Operators Program and secure the future of our kind. Join a camaraderie to fight for human prosperity. Return home with thick bonuses and the everlasting honor.<br><br><i>&quot;Our colonial program is nothing but the reflection our greatness&quot;</i><br>14th President Of The Inner Systems<br>Rufus Collins",
